{"root":{"data":{"id":"dle40c1pbsw0","created":1789294627248,"text":"数据链路层"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dle4jwshgxs0","created":1789296161322,"text":"数据链路层的功能","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dle4i443eqo0","created":1789296020533,"text":"组帧（封装成帧）"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dle4it13k680","created":1789296074771,"text":"主要问题"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dle4j5826gw0","created":1789296101314,"text":"帧定界"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dle4j9tdppk0","created":1789296111310,"text":"如何让接收方能够确定帧的界限"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dle4j79r1tc0","created":1789296105770,"text":"透明传输"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dle4jbuxds00","created":1789296115757,"text":"- 接收方链路层能够从收到的帧内恢复原始 SDU，让网络层“感受不到”将分组封装成帧的过程"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dle4jbuxboo0","created":1789296115757,"text":"- 接收方能够去除“帧定界”的附加信息，把帧“恢复原貌”"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dle4j0galpc0","created":1789296090928,"text":"四种组帧方法"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dle4jgfkggg0","created":1789296125712,"text":"字符计数法"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dle4jgfkbig0","created":1789296125712,"text":"字节填充法"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dle4jgfkdhs0","created":1789296125712,"text":"零比特填充法"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dle4jgfkjxc0","created":1789296125712,"text":"违规编码法"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dle4js8ly8w0","created":1789296151413,"text":"差错控制"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dle4lub28sg0","created":1789296312643,"text":"检错后丢弃并重传"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dle4m1ezm5c0","created":1789296328118,"text":"检错编码","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dle4m1f0bi80","created":1789296328119,"text":"奇偶校验码"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dle4m1f0hgg0","created":1789296328119,"text":"循环冗余校验码（CRC 码）"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dle4mk1hizk0","created":1789296368660,"text":"- 循环冗余校验（Cyclic Redundancy Check，CRC）"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dle4mk1gz880","created":1789296368660,"text":"- CRC 码的基本思想"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dle4mk1hcuo0","created":1789296368660,"text":"- 如何构造"},"children"